10a::1mod
10:8,9,10a:syl2anc |- ( ( ( P e. Prime /\ A e. ZZ /\ K e. NN0 ) /\ -. P || A ) -> ( 1 mod P ) = 1 )
11:5,10:eqtr4d |- ( ( ( P e. Prime /\ A e. ZZ /\ K e. NN0 ) /\ -. P || A ) -> ( ( A ^ ( P - 1 ) ) mod P ) = ( 1 mod P ) )
