24:23:oveq1d |- ( ( ( P e. Prime /\ A e. ZZ /\ K e. NN0 ) /\ -. P || A ) -> ( ( A ^ ( ( P - 1 ) x. K ) ) mod P ) = ( ( ( A ^ ( P - 1 ) ) ^ K ) mod P ) )
25:24,21:eqtrd |- ( ( ( P e. Prime /\ A e. ZZ /\ K e. NN0 ) /\ -. P || A ) -> ( ( A ^ ( ( P - 1 ) x. K ) ) mod P ) = ( 1 mod P ) )
